{{infobox entity
 | name = Fire Place
 | id   = 33
}}

* Deals a half-heart of damage when touched. {{dlc|r}} This damage is considered to be from a hostile source, not self-inflicted. {{i|Pyromaniac}} and {{i|Hot Bombs}} will prevent this damage.
* Can be extinguished by tears, bombs, or explosions.
* 25% chance to drop [[coin]]s (75% chance) or [[heart]]s (25% chance) when extinguished.
** {{dlc|r}} The chance to drop a reward is reduced to 10% while playing on [[Hard Mode]].
* [[Piercing tears]] and {{i|Explosivo}} shots can pierce through fire places and all of their variants. {{Dlc|nr}} [[Spectral tears]], however, are blocked.
* {{Dlc|r}} Spectral tears can pierce through fire places.

